window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A race against time. A detective pushed to her limits. The fate of the world hangs in the balance.</b></p> <p>Detective Bernadette Callahan embarks on a journey to find the one man who might hold the key to North America's climate crisis. From the depths of an undersea lab off Florida's coast and the lakes of Nicaragua to the frozen reaches of the High Arctic, she'll stop at nothing to uncover the truth and prevent catastrophe.</p> <p>With help from unlikely allies, the RCMP Detective must navigate a world of mythical clues, cutting-edge science, and government upheaval. But with a mole inside the FBI leaking information Callahan must stay one step ahead if she hopes to succeed.</p> <p>Join RCMP Detective Bernadette Callahan on her biggest case yet as she fights crime on her own terms and discover the lengths one woman will go to save the world from itself.</p> <p><b>A must-listen for fans of fast-paced, humorous murder thrillers and police procedurals featuring a strong female lead.</b></p>"; 
